# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# valid values implementation is a multi-link relationship.  The attach above returns the new relationship's unique identifier;
# these two requests act on that single relationship.  The detach that takes the two end GUIDs removes them all.

@validValuesImplementationRelationshipGUID=add guid here
###
# @name updateValidValueImplementation
# Update the properties of a valid values implementation relationship.
POST {{baseURL}}/servers/{{viewServer}}/api/open-metadata/reference-data/valid-value-implementations/{{validValuesImplementationRelationshipGUID}}/update
